monitoring server) to request commands to be run on this machine (the monitored machine) which return the status of the machine.\n- Submit the same results to a remote (monitoring server).\n- Take action and perform tasks.","moniker":"nscp","name":"NSClient++","packageUrl":"https://nsclient.org/","publisher":"MySolutions NORDIC","publisherUrl":"https://medin.name/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.11.29","tags":["icinga","naemon","nagios"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"可与多种监控工具协同使用的全功能监控代理","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"NSClient++（nscp）旨在成为一个简单而强大且安全的监控守护进程。它最初为 Nagios/Icinga 设计，但守护进程本身并不局限于 Nagios/Icinga，可广泛应用于需要接收或分发检查指标的其他场景中。\n该守护进程主要具备三项核心功能：\n- 允许远程主机（监控服务器）请求在本机（被监控主机）上执行命令，以获取主机状态信息。\n- 将相同的检测结果主动提交至远程（监控服务器）。\n- 执行预设操作并完成任务处理。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.11.29","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://medin.name/","releaseDate":"2026-04-07","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.11.29","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.29.0/Mickem.NSClient.yaml","sha256":"51efd9350d4de60be4989eb047da6abc96cdd13c171b7020efdb0db077cee9c1"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.29.0/Mickem.NSClient.installer.yaml","sha256":"99de5b6693cc7c5a469a13cc2531bbe24159e90d80dad0b918ad89bafb6f9c67"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.29.0/Mickem.NSClient.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"037519ded515a0dbac03df62c6d861e36525c56384f29680833464d42648cd87"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.11.29.0/Mickem.NSClient.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"6165a3025d458ed01d5184fed99e09296b11edae63d16d37c7a47126de31a760"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.29.0"}